From 2f9d8353dccb3717d2fa2a2d1e5fdcd46ae5762e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 03:26:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix: numbness follows the console (numb parts named, no agony
 ideas for them, hard rule allows engine numbness), wing strain breaking point
 and glide, whole-body hits list the hardest-hit parts, linger on a real blow,
 one feeling-comes-back note

---
 engine.py   |   7 ++-
 narrator.py | 139 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++----------
 play.py     |   3 ++
 rules.json  |   2 +
 4 files changed, 123 insertions(+), 28 deletions(-)

